00:00:24.906 --> 00:00:25.769
.

00:00:25.769 --> 00:00:26.602
18,000.

00:00:26.602 --> 00:00:28.175
18,000 frames per second.

00:00:28.175 --> 00:00:29.080
It's definitely going to surface,

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.215
it's just gonna like.

00:00:30.215 --> 00:00:32.340
I'm gonna wash my eye
