completely collapsed.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:34.710
See which one happens first?

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:35.775
Gravity or bubble?

00:02:35.775 --> 00:02:36.608
Let's go.

00:02:38.572 --> 00:02:39.405
